WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,820 --> 00:00:06,220
Today's training is over

2
00:00:06,620 --> 00:00:08,820
You and your natal spirit animal have done well.

3
00:00:10,890 --> 00:00:11,890
tell the truth

4
00:00:12,290 --> 00:00:14,290
I didn't expect this weak fox to be able to hold on

5
00:00:14,290 --> 00:00:16,090
His will is much stronger than it looks

6
00:00:16,920 --> 00:00:18,520
From now on, soak every other day

7
00:00:18,920 --> 00:00:21,320
The concoction can be used three to five times before being stored.

8
00:00:21,920 --> 00:00:24,520
If you need anything, you can go to the fifth-level elixir garden to find me.

9
00:00:26,270 --> 00:00:28,070
Thank you, Senior Sister Duanmu, Junior Brother Chu

10
00:00:28,470 --> 00:00:29,870
People who came to see Master before

11
00:00:30,070 --> 00:00:32,070
I can't even put my hand into the concoction box and hold it.

12
00:00:32,070 --> 00:00:34,670
You and your natal spiritual beast are both of a Taoist nature.

13
00:00:34,870 --> 00:00:36,470
It's not the kind of thing that you just talk about

14
00:00:36,870 --> 00:00:38,270
But this is only the first time

15
00:00:38,470 --> 00:00:40,070
Thousands of times in the future

16
00:00:40,270 --> 00:00:41,670
The more painful thing is yet to come.

17
00:00:41,670 --> 00:00:42,870
I will stick to it

18
00:00:43,340 --> 00:00:44,740
Master appreciates you very much

19
00:00:44,740 --> 00:00:46,340
He intends to accept you as his disciple

20
00:00:46,340 --> 00:00:47,740
But the rules of the Red Sale Sect

21
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:49,940
A handyman disciple cannot defeat an elder as his teacher

22
00:00:49,940 --> 00:00:51,540
You must first become an outer disciple

23
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:53,400
The big red sale is coming soon

24
00:00:53,400 --> 00:00:54,400
behave well

25
00:00:54,400 --> 00:00:55,600
Don't embarrass Master

26
00:00:55,600 --> 00:00:56,600
Senior sister, don't worry

27
00:00:56,600 --> 00:00:58,000
I will definitely live up to the elders
